{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/park-boulevard-meteora-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":568,"crm_id":"1044","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Park Boulevard","slug":"park-boulevard-meteora-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Meteora","price":722222,"display_price":"722K","lattitude":25.0602489,"longitude":55.2151317,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Park Boulevard - an exciting development by developer Meteora, located in the vibrant Jumeirah Village Circle neighbourhood in the heart of Dubai. The development offers the perfect blend of contemporary design, luxury and comfort, creating an inviting environment to live, work and relax.</p><p>The building rises 19 storeys above the city, 14 of which are home to luxury <strong>1-2 bedroom apartments,</strong> which are designed in a contemporary style using the most advanced technology and materials. Each residence is designed with the comfort and convenience of residents in mind, offering luxurious interiors, spacious spaces and panoramic views of the surrounding nature and cityscape.</p><p>Park Boulevard also features a variety of amenities within the complex, including a fitness centre, swimming pool, sports courts and children's play areas. Here you can enjoy an active lifestyle, spend time with family and friends, and enjoy your free time. One of the main highlights of the complex is the park, which is harmoniously integrated into the surrounding landscape and offers a variety of recreational areas. It creates the perfect atmosphere for relaxing, strolling and gathering with family and friends. Close to Park Boulevard there are restaurants, cafes, supermarkets and shops.</p><p>JVC is located in the heart of the city and has convenient access to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Al Khail Road, which provide quick and easy access to various parts of the city. Places such as Dubai Marin, Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa can be reached in just 15-20 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1044/images/2024/02/20/m0TmiR46Jf9pBtxaaDsBlzuGekpZLSsCZi59mTUU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/20/m0TmiR46Jf9pBtxaaDsBlzuGekpZLSsCZi59mTUU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1044/images/2024/02/20/iQesmprnAhAl4YTO2fVAxEoyJsVefCyMXKH76zSm.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/20/iQesmprnAhAl4YTO2fVAxEoyJsVefCyMXKH76zSm.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1044/images/2024/02/20/jDliFToNfOTsMoFqRrKx2llYBQMcXh4veN6fqesw.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/20/jDliFToNfOTsMoFqRrKx2llYBQMcXh4veN6fqesw.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2858,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/20/rx6VmjWvRbbU3P1Zms5m8AjKQtDgIdcOlfdOQYDY.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1108,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1876,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1877,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"60/40","payment_plans":[{"id":5606,"title":"5%","description":"On booking"},{"id":5607,"title":"15%","description":"Within 30 days"},{"id":5608,"title":"10%","description":"Within 4 m